<title>USA: Graff changes name to Spice.</title>
<headline>Graff changes name to Spice.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Graff Pay-Per-View Inc said on Tuesday it will change its name to Spice Entertainment Inc and trade under Nasdaq symbol &quot;SPZE&quot; from &quot;GPPV&quot; as of December 2 1996.</p>
<p>The company, known as Graff Pay-Per-View since its incorporation in 1987, said the name change reflects its core business focus and global branding strategy.</p>
<p>Spice Entertainment, providers of adult television entertainment, was trading up 1/4 at 1-5/8 minutes after midday.</p>
</text>
